Monster Flags 2: Movement?
asleep (A)  = Starts asleep
wakens (W)  = Wakes up when you are close ((45%, 75% party room), /3 if stealthy)
              Removes Imitation, asleep (Not if napping), can wander in.
wanders (D) = Can wander in as a new monster (Occurs every 120 turns)
