* There are initally 4-6 monsters per level
* Monsters will not move 15% of time
* All monsters are hasted above level (AMULET_LEVEL + 10)
* Confused monsters will not special hit 66% of the time
* Monster Party Room: Occurs roughly every 3 levels, has twice as many
  monsters as items, Monster can appear up to 2 levels earlier than normal.
  They wake up 75% of the time when you enter.
  If level with MPR there is 1% chance of a single Big Room.
* Monsters will sometimes leave treasure behind when they die. A steals_gold
  guy drops gold, a tasty has 15% chance to leave carcase, otherwise monster
  drop % to drop an item. (Not when you are leaving dungeon)
* Chance Monster hit you: Reduced by Experience, RingDex, increased by # rings worn
  Damage Monster hit you:
* Chance You hit monster:
  Damage You hit monster: Higher strength will increase monster damage.
* Wizards are half as likely to be hit and damage is divided by 3.
  Wizards are twice as likely to hit, and triple the damage done.

