* Weapon probability: 50% of time get first 12 weapons only else any weapon.
  Collection weapons created get 3-15 items, Quiver is 0-126?
  Weapon can be +1 (16.7%) or -1 cursed (16.7%). If so, it gets
  1-3 blessings of hit_enchant or dice_enchant (coin toss as to which)
* Increased hit chance for ^Str, ^Exp, ^RingDex, !#rings.
  Hit chance starts with 50% + first digit of damage? (2d6 -=> 52?) strange.
* Better hit chance: NonThrown NonMissile. Thrown Missile.
  Thrown NonMissile has less damage.
  If a missile has a launcher, better if you weld the launcher.
  If a missile has no launcher, better if you weld the missile.
* Weapon value is +d_enchant*85 +hit_enchant*85

THROWING:
* Max throw distance is 24 (8 in tunnel). Stops at walls and traps.
  Thrown wands will go off 75% of time. You cannot throw cursed item.
  Throwing weapon does normal %Hit Damage, but weapon is damaged
* A hit monster will wake up, not seek gold, and shriek if able
  Imitating monsters will not be hit

