* Rings: All equal probability, all weigh 3, except for the R_Burden (300)
* Worn rings make you easier to hit, harder for you to hit, and you digest faster
  The sum of worn ring food cost is divided by 2 to determine extra food turns
* Ring Class: -2-2 Means random -2,-1,1,2 class (not 0). Cursed if -2 or -1.
* Ring Curse: 1 = cursed, 50% = 50% chance cursed, negative class means cursed
* If (RING_WARNING|RING_ESP)&90% or (RING_MOOD|RING_DELUSION))&40% and party room,
  then "you hear something". Also when RING_DELUSION & 20% and no party room
* RingESP: Says "sense hostility" when you go up/down level with RingAggr
* SlowDigestRing: If sum of food < 0, you use food at 1/2 rate! (If 8 SDR, no food)

TRAPS (6):
trap door        : Drops you to next level of dungeon
bear trap        : Stuck 4-7 Move turns (Not RingFreeAction)
teleport trap    : Teleports you on this level
poison dart trap : HP damage 1d6. 40% chance STR-1 min 2 (Not RingSustStr)
sleeping gas trap: "fall asleep" sleep for 2-5 turns (Not RingAlert RingBreath)
rust trap        : "gush water" rust
* Traps will fail (Exp+RingDex)% of time
* Traps on level: level 0-3 has 0 traps, 3-7 has 0-2, 8-11 has 1-2,
                  12-16 has 2-3, 17-21 has 2-4, 22-AMUL+2 has 3-5, else 5-10
                  First trap placed in Monster Party room.
* Avoid traps by levitating with a ring or scroll

MISC:
* Initial Armor Ring Mail Class 3, Weapon Mace 2d3, Bow 1d2, 25-35 arrows 1d2
* Gold: 46% of rooms have gold. Mazes always have gold and 50% more.
  Maze rooms are currently commented out due to a bug.
* Object Creation: On random 1-91, create Scroll (1-30), Potion (31-60),
  Wand (61-64), Weapon (65-74), Armor (75-83), Food (84-88), or Ring (89-91).
* Amulet appears on level 27 and greater. You can only go up with Amulet.
  You loose experience level as you go up, and you don't get hungrier
* Weight is shown. You can carry 1500+50*(Str-8), unless weak(90%) or faint(50%)
* Searching: (17+Exp+RingDex)% find hidden item (Not Blind)
* End of game: Sum up value of items carried. Amulet is worth 5000.
* Pack order is FOOD, WEAPON, ARMOR, SCROLL, POTION, WAND, RING, AMULET

Food: Ration weighs 400, fruit weighs 300
* You are guarenteed a food every 2 levels.
* Get ration 80% of time, fruit 20% of time.
* I don't think food spoils.
* Hungry at 300, Weak at 150, Faint at 20, Starve at 0.
* When you eat, your old moves_left is /3. (i.e. only eat when hungry!)
* Alive: 40% Ration,Carcase: worth 700-900 "yuk", Adds experience
  60% Ration,Carcase, 100% Fruit: worth 900-1100 "Yum","not too bad","Yummy"
* Undead: Carcase worth 900-1100 "enjoy"
  Ration worth 100-200 "unsatisfying", Fruit worth 50-150 "gnaw on vile"
  Drink blood 25% of time you kill a monster. Old moves /3. Adds 500-700 moves.

Load Character:
* Undead: food = (hungry+weak)/2. If "strangely hungry", food += f(HP)
* Normal:
   42% "rifled pockets": Gold = gold mod 100 (times 1/2 10% of time)
   25% "don't recall"  : Drop Exp just short of dropping level
   17% "shaky, weak"   : Drop STR by 1 minimum 3, 10% chance STRmax = STRcur.
   17% "distressingly" : Drop HPmax by 1 (10% chance of 2) minimum 5.

